WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.850
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.950
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.080
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.500
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.730
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:07.100
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:57.680
Sister!

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.810
I am glad you have safely returned.

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:12.530
Renfa, you don't have to be so formal.

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:18.660
My apologies.  I heard you were injured on the battlefield, so I panicked.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:21.140
It was just a scratch.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.270
Thank goodness.

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:27.080
What's wrong Renfa?  Is there something you would like to say?

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:33.580
Sister, why do you like so much to wage war?

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:40.700
Sonken, watch what you are saying.  Sonsaku does this to improve the Son family's reputation.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:45.300
It is true that all these battles have strengthened our position...

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:48.180
And the Son family name has gained eminence in neighboring countries.

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:54.120
However, the country's foundation and its citizens are suffering from it.   At this rate we will soon...

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:55.600
Fall?

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:58.210
No, that's not what I meant!

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:04.810
Sorry to have kept everyone waiting.

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:07.550
The preparation for the banquet is...

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.800
Complete?

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:17.020
<b>Sonsaku’s Life is Threatened</b>

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:26.200
Hi!  Now, the beautiful twin girls of Koutou...

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:27.710
Daikyō and...

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:28.850
Shōkyō!

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:30.170
We’ll now sing for you.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:44.860
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:47.660
Ah, so this is where you were.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:49.920
Lord Sonsaku.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:54.690
Meirin, didn’t we agree to call each other by our first name, when we’re alone?

00:03:55.490 --> 00:03:57.250
You are correct, Sheren.

00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:00.530
What’s wrong?   You look depressed.

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:07.010
I wonder what’s troubling Shuuyu, the famed tactician of the Son family.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:11.160
I have been thinking about Sonken.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:12.760
About Renfa?

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:17.070
She can’t really see past her nose.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:22.010
It is true that the constant wars of the past few years have exhausted our citizens.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:28.460
If we stop now, we might be able to rule over Koutou, but that will be it.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.970
In the end, we won’t be able to get our hands on the whole country.

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:36.600
No matter how hard it is, we have to keep fighting for our future.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.750
And yet, Sonken is…

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:43.940
You’re right, but that’s also to her benefit.

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:48.590
My late mother, Sonken, was known as the Tiger of Koutou.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:53.880
With these bloodstained hands, I have pillaged many in order to carry out the wishes of my predecessor.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:57.840
If she was the first, she’d be the one inheriting, protecting and nurturing them.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.890
That’s how I feel.

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:01.710
What an ominous thing to say.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:02.810
Eh?  Ominous?

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:09.250
Yes. You speak as though you will die before fulfilling your aspiration.

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:14.740
Meirin, you think too much.

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:17.160
But, Sheren…

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.740
Geez, you are too smart for your own good.

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.170
Don’t worry.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:28.670
I will seize this country with my own hand.

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:32.130
And give it to Renfa after that.

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.550
Sheren.

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:40.970
Meirin, you will be by my side until I fulfill my ambition, right?

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:42.830
Yes, I will.

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:53.300
War, war, war.  How many times has it been this year so far?

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:57.330
Exactly.   Our people don’t even have the opportunity to plow their lands.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:04.410
Lord Choushou, you are the most senior of us elders.  Can’t you protest this?

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:12.220
I have many times, but Sonsaku is giving Shuyuu the run of the place.

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:15.380
She seems resistant to my argument.

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:19.600
Shuuyu, eh?   Damn that young and inexperienced subordinate!

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:24.860
It is absurd that she is in command of the policy issues, completely disregarding our point of views.

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:29.800
Lord Choushou, since things have turned out this way, let us carry out our plan as soon as possible.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:33.000
Yes.  The arrangements have already been made.

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:35.550
So, that means we are finally…

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:40.490
We will overthrow that war-loving Sonsaku!  If we allow <i>that person</i> to become the Son family leader…

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:44.550
We will definitely be able to continue our proper positions.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:49.050
I can’t wait to see Shuuyu’s crying face when the dust settles.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:59.680
This is the Yangtze River, huh?  It’s huge!

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:03.170
Isn’t it breathtaking?   Isn’t it fantastic?

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:07.150
It <i>is </i>fantastic, not exactly something you should brag about.

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:11.670
Ah, looking at this makes me feel like I’m back.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:16.350
Setting the “I’m back” feeling aside, are you going to be alright, Shoukou?

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:17.170
What are you talking about?

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:20.380
You ran away from home, didn’t you?

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:26.200
It’s good that you’ve grown tired of traveling and decided to return home.  But won’t your family scold you?

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:32.460
What are you saying?  I, princess Shoa, am the most beloved princess in the Son family.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:38.030
Upon my return, they will all cry tears of joy.  There’s no way they would scold me.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:41.360
Geez, what on earth were you thinking?

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:48.060
A princess from the Son family should not take off without any servants.  Do you have any idea what you put us through?

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:53.410
Umm… honorable Aunt Sonsei, I had a good reason for that.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:54.540
There is no excuse!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:08:01.010
Besides, you always act on your own.  Do you know the trouble you caused the people around you?

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.700
They’re all showing their bellybuttons.

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:07.440
Yeah.  Maybe this is a tradition of some kind in her family?

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:11.750
So Shoukou wasn’t just a silly kid after all!

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:14.210
Honorable Aunt, let’s just stop there.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.340
But Lord Sonsaku…

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:20.370
If you keep this up, she will run away again.

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:25.750
Kan’u…  It appears my younger sister has caused you quite a bit of trouble.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:27.390
Big time!

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:28.770
Hey, Rin Rin!

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:31.760
You have my sympathy!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:34.590
Big sister Sheren, that’s mean.

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:42.930
Kan’u, Chōhi and Koumei, the Son family of Koutou welcomes you.

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:45.410
Please spend some time with us.

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:50.230
<i>Hide under the bed.  Hurry!</i>

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:51.960
<i>Close your eyes and don’t move.</i>

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:57.330
A dream, eh?

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:03.310
But why am I dreaming this now?  Plus, my chest feels heavy.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:10.260
This meat bun is mine.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.620
So you’re the reason, huh.

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:18.350
You seem to be sleepy still.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.720
I drank a little too much last night.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:25.840
You talked to Kan’u quite a bit.

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:31.370
Yes, she is very skilled.  It is a shame to let her go.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:35.650
And that kid Chōhi is very amusing.

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:39.710
If she wouldn’t grow any bigger than that, I’d like to keep her in the garden.

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:41.910
Woof!  Woof!

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:43.920
You are being silly.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:47.290
So, our guests are already up?

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:54.400
Yes, they’ve already had breakfast.  Kan’u and Chōhi left with Shoukou to the hunting ground on the hill.

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:56.630
Is anyone else with them?

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:59.370
I sent Kannei as their guide.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.380
Really?  That makes me feel better.

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:06.920
Koumei has expressed an interest in seeing the library, so Rikuson is showing her the way.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:13.650
This is the first time I’ve seen so many books!

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:17.000
Other than the obvious subjects, like politics and tactics…

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:20.720
There are also books on agriculture, astronomy, poetry and some almanacs.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:24.160
We have all sorts of different collections here.

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:29.130
Is it possible that you have read all these books?

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:33.090
I do love books.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:34.540
Me too.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.440
Books are great.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:42.560
When I read books, the pleasure of the new knowledge washes over me like waves.

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:47.440
That pleasure satisfies the core of my being.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:54.330
Nah, my experience is a little different.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:15.660
Well done, Lord Shoukou.   I will fetch your kill.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.100
Thank you, Kannei.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:22.420
I might not be as good as Kouchuu, but I have confidence in my shooting skills.

00:11:23.020 --> 00:11:27.300
Humph, bragging with your flat chest sticking out doesn’t make you look cool at all.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:33.750
Hey, what do you mean by “flat chest”?  Isn’t your flat-chest figure more childish than mine?

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:38.430
I saw yours at the hot spring and it isn’t much different than mine.

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:43.250
You said it!  We should have a contest and see if there’s a difference or not.

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:44.660
Bring it on!

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:48.030
What, you guys are arguing over stupid stuff again.

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.880
It’s not stupid!

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:52.460
That’s right; the person with ample bosoms needs to shut up!

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:54.350
You said ample…

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:56.580
Chōhi, let’s have our breast size competition over there.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:57.650
Okay.

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:00.800
There will be three stages to this competition: Size, shape and sensitivity.

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.260
Let’s look at a mountain bird.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:24.550
Shuuyu!

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:26.850
Shuuyu!

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:28.510
Lord Sonken.

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:31.460
Is it true that my sister was attacked?

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.330
I’m afraid so.

00:12:33.990 --> 00:12:37.950
Just before noon, someone shot her with an arrow, while she was relaxing here.

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:39.210
An arrow?

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:46.850
So, what is her condition?

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:51.380
The wound is shallow, but the arrowhead was poisoned.

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:59.380
The poison was sucked out right away, so she escaped death.  However, she has not yet regained consciousness.

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:02.680
No way!  Big sister…

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.980
Big catch, big catch.

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:09.060
We’ll have boar meat stew for lunch today!

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:15.010
Kan’u, Chōhi!

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.720
You are under arrest!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:30.900
Kan’u, what’s happened?

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:35.980
What, Kan’u tried to assassinate Lord Sonsaku?

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:41.970
It must be some kind of a mistake.  There is no way she would do something like that!

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:44.700
Do… do you have any evidence?

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:46.680
We do not.

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:48.380
Then why?

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:50.980
We don’t have any concrete evidence.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:56.820
The hunting ground on the hill is the most logical place for shooting an arrow at Lord Sonsaku.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:04.090
At the moment that she was shot, an unknown traveling warrior figure was standing there.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.250
Isn’t it natural to suspect her?

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:07.980
No!

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:13.680
If I remember correctly, one of your subordinates was with her at the hunting ground.

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:19.040
Kannei was there, but she was not with her the whole time.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:29.650
When Lord Sonsaku was shot, I left Kan’u to retrieve Lord Shoukou’s kill.

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:32.080
But she should have been nearby.

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:38.280
Chōhi and I were not with her either at the time…

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:41.930
But it’s unfair to suspect Aisha because of that.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.270
Yes, it is.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:51.140
Kannei, you just said you left Kanu’s side to retrieve the kill, right?

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:54.010
Indeed, I did.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:15:01.950
So, when Lord Sonsaku was shot, you were alone in the hunting ground as well?

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:04.890
You little punk, what are you trying to say?

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:08.870
I am saying if Kan’u is a suspect, because she was alone in the hunting ground…

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:13.150
On the same ground, you should also be a suspect!

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:17.830
Stop being ridiculous!  I work for the Son family!

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:21.050
To accuse me of plotting Lord Sonsaku’s assassination...

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:24.770
It’s a good motive.

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:29.490
Because the lord and subordinates are in contact every day...

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:33.700
There are daily frictions, differences of opinion and common interests.

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:36.620
You will have a stronger motive to kill her…

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:42.700
Than a traveling warrior, who has no connection to the family, don’t you think?

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:45.890
That’s what I get for allowing you to speak, you little brat.

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:53.550
Don’t think I will let you get away with insulting a warrior like this!

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:59.750
Kan’u is as proud a warrior as you are Kannei!

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:07.370
We will not let you get away with insulting her without any evidence!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:12.440
Stop right there!  Kannei, drop your sword.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:13.990
But…

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.260
I’m ordering you to drop your sword.

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:26.290
Lord Sonken, your behavior is somewhat rash.

00:16:26.890 --> 00:16:30.610
I understand that you are frustrated over Lord Sonsaku’s assassination attempt…

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:38.160
For that reason, you need to be calm and lead everyone.

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:40.790
This is the duty of a leader, don’t you agree?

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:46.210
Yes Shuuyu, you are correct.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.210
Kan’u, I am sorry.

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:59.390
No, if you understand, that’s already…

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:05.380
Are you alright, Koumei?

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:10.130
I overdid it a bit.

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:13.280
Big sister…

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:18.530
Sonken, you’re still here?

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.090
Honorable Aunt.

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:27.990
I know you are worried about Sonsaku’s condition, but at this rate you will collapse.

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:31.430
Lord Sonken.  Ah, Honorable Sonsei!

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.980
What’s all the fuss this late at night?

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.150
Could it be that big sister?

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:40.360
No, it is the opposite.  Lord Sonsaku’s condition has improved.

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:45.850
She is still unconscious, but the doctor said she passed the critical stage.

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:50.310
Thank goodness.  Big sister, I am really happy.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.790
The doctor said she needs to rest for a while.

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:57.330
Once her fever breaks, you can visit and talk to her.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:15.550
I see... The tip of that needle had poison on it, didn’t it?

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:20.120
You finally showed your true colors, honorable Aunt.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:25.750
Did you become impatient hearing my condition has improved?

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:28.340
Sonsaku, you‘re not…

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:32.800
Supposed to be almost dead, eh?

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:38.470
I knew you were unhappy with the way I do things…

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:44.960
But I didn’t expect that you'd go as far as killing me. Even in this chaotic time, this is pretty shameful.

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:53.320
Sonsei, please excuse us.  We are putting you under arrest for the crimes of treason.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:57.040
Shuuyu, did you plan this?

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:59.520
I have no idea what you are talking about.

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:04.020
Sonsaku, the way you are running things is wrong.

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:06.320
No matter how much the gain...

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:11.810
The immeasurable amount of blood you’ve shed will return to haunt the Son family someday!

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:15.740
I’ve been aware of that since the moment I decided to carry out my mother’s last wishes...

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:17.790
And set on the path of conquest.

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:25.000
However, honorable Aunt, I will spill as much as blood as necessary to get what I want.

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:28.120
Take her away.

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:29.220
Yes, Ma’am.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:32.980
I see, so it’s over, eh.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:35.630
Yes, everything went smoothly.

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:39.920
What’s left to do now is to take care of the names on this document.

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:44.280
This is the agreement of the plot.

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:48.180
It will be irrefutable evidence of treason.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:49.160
Yes.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:53.570
But we’ve caused Kan’u a lot of problems.

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:58.990
I guess you could say she was in the wrong place at the wrong time.

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:06.290
But I didn’t expect Sonken to catch an assassin that really didn’t exist.  That was too unpredictable.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:14.850
Even a renowned tactician cannot foresee everything, unless she is God.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.250
Thank you.

00:20:18.970 --> 00:20:22.910
I wish I could discuss more books with you.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:25.180
Me too, Rikuson.

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:28.150
When you feel like discussing a book, please write me.

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.810
Yes, I will.

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:33.110
We couldn’t settle this the other day.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:40.090
Next time when we meet, it will be a seven round match:  Size, shape, color, gloss, sensitivity, elasticity and taste.

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:41.620
I’ll be ready for you!

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:44.580
Hey, are you two still going on about that?

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:45.590
Kan’u.

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:49.980
I don’t know how to apologize to you about what happened.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:53.950
As I said many times, it’s already…

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:57.320
There was something wrong with me.

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:03.590
I lost my head and suspected an innocent bystander.

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:08.270
It was very inappropriate of me, as someone who holds a position of authority, to do that.

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:13.190
If you don't admit that you made a mistake, that is a real mistake.

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:17.410
Everyone makes mistakes.

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:22.450
After the mistake is made, recognize it, 
and apologize for it.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:25.160
Then make sure the same mistake doesn’t happen again.

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:32.440
Since you did all that, I think you have all the qualifications to exercise authority.

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:33.960
Kan’u.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:38.960
Now, see us off on our journey with a happy face, alright?

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:48.490
It’s nice to travel by boat.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:52.180
We can reach our destination while relaxing.

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:57.150
Yeah.  It would be great to travel on land while relaxing too.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:00.830
Ah, what’s wrong Koumei, are you seasick?

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:04.690
Nah, there’s something that’s been bothering me.

00:22:05.110 --> 00:22:06.400
Something’s bothering you?

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:13.700
Yes.  Was that incident really an attempted assassination?

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:22.530
Everything seems too perfect, as if we were watching a play.

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:30.980
Yep, I feel like someone wrote a plot for that incident.

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:36.410
Shuuyu.

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:39.850
Ah, Rikuson, did you already see them off?

00:22:40.090 --> 00:22:40.580
Yes.

00:22:41.480 --> 00:22:44.820
Rikuson, what do you think of Koumei?

00:22:45.200 --> 00:22:50.970
Let me see.  She deduced a well organized theory at such a young age.

00:22:51.150 --> 00:22:55.600
When a sword was pointed at her, she was brave enough not to flinch.

00:22:55.980 --> 00:23:00.050
I am looking forward to see how she’ll grow up.

00:23:00.470 --> 00:23:05.060
Looking forward to it, huh?  Matter of fact she scares me.

00:23:06.380 --> 00:23:12.600
I don’t know why, but I have a feeling she will stand in our way someday.

00:23:14.340 --> 00:23:19.380
That is, when the time comes, and she secures a position that suits her intelligence.

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:36.110
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:41.250
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:23:42.680 --> 00:23:46.960
<i>Anywhere I am, it always turns into paradise.</i>

00:23:47.890 --> 00:23:51.480
<i>Every season, mellow and carefree.
Today and tomorrow, always an adventure.</i>

00:23:51.650 --> 00:23:56.800
<i>I run away when times are tough.
But get involved when easy and fun.</i>

00:23:56.930 --> 00:24:01.800
<i>If I stress, I just stop and smell the roses.  If there's a great opportunity, I go for it!</i>

00:24:01.980 --> 00:24:07.090
<i>There are so many things that I want.</i>

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:14.490
<i>I am so brave, that I can take on the invincible.</i>

00:24:14.810 --> 00:24:19.670
<i>After all said and done, I am the heroine of this world.</i>

00:24:19.950 --> 00:24:24.860
<i>The world revolves around me.  I am the center of the world!</i>

00:24:25.130 --> 00:24:29.970
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:24:30.210 --> 00:24:35.290
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:24:45.210 --> 00:24:51.990
<b>Cutie-cute</b>
